msgstr "Clarify vision, mission and goals, design a 3-year Strategic Framework and a House Strategy every team understands, and prepare People, Process and Culture to support the change."

#: patterns/transformation-business.php:29
msgid "แปลงกลยุทธ์สู่การปฏิบัติจริง"
msgstr "Turn strategy into action"

#: patterns/transformation-business.php:31
